WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.510
What’s going on?!

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.010
...are you alright..?

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.110
I’m... okay...

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.300
Bursting out to cause a ruckus and scaring
the kids... What do you hope to gain?!

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.180
Tart! Stop this nonsense at once!!

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.640
Geez, how’d you know it was me?

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:41.040
Who else would use these giant toys?!

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.640
Doing this around the kids is wrong!!

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.560
Oh shut up, you!!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.400
You always like to ruin
everything! Attack!

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.490
Same old tricks...

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:01.620
Ha! Those spikes are coated with oil.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.570
Attack!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.500
Bu-Ling! Look out!!

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.690
Torunedo-Bakuretsu-Ken!!

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:29.670
Who is that man?

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.260
He defeated the Chimera Anima
so quickly!

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.510
How’s that possible?

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.530
That’s...!!

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:40.990
That technique is definitely the deadly KouEnJi Kenpou.

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:50.460
Pleased to meet you,
I am Ron Yuebin, Miss Bu-Ling.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.790
Eh!? “Miss Bu-Ling”?

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:59.020
Pfft, who is this guy?!

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:07.670
...so, you somehow knew Mew Pudding’s true identity.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.340
It sure took us by surprise.

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.760
It was obvious once she
made her move.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:17.110
I was sent here by the young Miss’s father
Master Wong Taren to find her.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.350
But this is so unbelievable...

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:26.080
such a handsome guy came to Bu-Ling’s rescue...

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:31.320
Oh my... my heart...

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.550
Ye...yeah...

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.550
Anyways, what did Father send you here for?

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:46.130
Yes. Up till now, I’ve been training
diligently with Master on Kenpou.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:52.480
Master recently recognized my mastery
of the KouEnJi Kenpou.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.700
Congratulations.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:03:00.560
Masters words were: KouEnJi Kenpou can
only be passed down to one candidate...

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:06.370
You must now go to Japan for one final
lesson, if you wish to claim that honor.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.150
KouEnJi Kenpou’s succession?

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:11.030
Final lesson?

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:12.880
What is this final lesson about?

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:18.130
I must compete with the other candidate for that right.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:24.850
I challenge you to a duel for the
honor as the next successor.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:26.970
Ehhh??

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.050
Very well.

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:37.650
However, defeating Bu-Ling,
the 25th successor of KouEnJi Kenpou,

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.490
isn’t going to be easy.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.810
I’m prepared for that.
Now, let’s begin.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.860
My hands are ready!

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.480
Hold on... You’re doing here?!

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:50.360
Yes, there’s no choice,
we have to do this now.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.820
This won’t be pretty...

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.790
That stance...

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.500
I don’t quite understand it, but...

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.360
It does seem like a powerful
fighting style.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.000
I lost...

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:46.890
There’s one more thing
you should know...

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:48.180
Eh...?

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:53.400
You can say that...
I just became your betrothed.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.350
What does that mean?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:06.770
It was decreed that, should I win,
I would become your fiancé.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:09.280
Wha... ?! Arranged Marriage?!
With Bu-Ling?!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.910
What?! Why wasn’t I told!!
This is outrageous!!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.690
First of all, Bu-Ling’s still
in grade school...

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.570
Don’t you think this is
a bit too early?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.950
Well, we’re not getting married immediately.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:27.390
I’m just stating the facts as they were
conveyed to me by the Master.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:33.880
As the winner put it, having a child
as a betrothed is stretching it.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:37.050
That’s just archaic ways!!!

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:43.340
There’s no way I’d ever agree to this marriage... EVER!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:46.150
Now, leave this place at once!!

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:49.500
I have no choice but to leave for now.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.330
But despite our disagreement I am not giving up.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.540
Whatever, I’m not changing my mind.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.320
Very well, “zai jian.”

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.410
This is what’s visible under Tokyo.

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.830
Energy, electromagnetism, water...

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.670
a complete picture assembled from our observations.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:15.210
You mean as in Geomancy, the Separate Arteries?

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:21.980
Yes. We’ve been scanning the buildings in the city area.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.700
One in particular, the Indoor Sports Hall is
giving off unusually high energy readings.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.470
Could it be a Mew Aqua?

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:35.660
l can’t tell. But Mew Aqua is capable
of assuming any form.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:47.990
Chincha, Hanacha, Lucha, Honcha & Heicha can have special Crab roe Tenshin rice tonight.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:53.090
There’s so much Oho-tsuku Sea Zuwai
Crab. They’ll be so happy.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:59.510
What’s this? It smells sooo good...

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:07.220
Welcome home, m’lady.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:12.690
Tonight we’re having beef stroganoff.
Everyone’s waiting for you.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.740
I’m starving!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.700
Itadakimasu!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:24.220
Hold on everyone... We’re supposed to
have Kanidama Tenshinha tonight...

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.220
There you go.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.240
Mmm, it’s good.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:31.870
Haha.. Please, have some more.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.550
Geez, that’s not the point!!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.350
I have to leave now!!!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.750
Never thought I’d be late.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:44.310
Heicha will probably cry if she’s all alone.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:48.860
Sorry to keep you waiting...

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:52.780
What’s that? Higher?! Higher?!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.810
I’m fine, even though ’neechan isn’t here!

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:56.740
Heicha!!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.980
Ah, ’neechan!

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:00.490
C’mon, let’s go home.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:04.740
Heicha wants Yuebin-san to carry
her instead of ’neechan.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:10.920
He’s soooo cooooool~!!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:24.440
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Here’s our stores chiffon cake.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.900
Waaahhh!! Such skills!!!

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.890
Hahaha... My pleasure.

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:34.520
Argh! How am I suppose to introduce
the menu with you in my way?!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:39.940
How about a show of our martial arts here, m’lady?

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:42.150
We can have a performance?

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:44.620
No, I just want to be left alone!

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:50.750
I can’t go on like this.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.870
Bu-Ling-san seems to be stressed out.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:57.500
Come on! She has a handsome guy running after her...

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.870
and she still finds life difficult?!

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:04.280
But, do Yuebin-san and Bu-Ling have to get married?

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.690
They barely know each other.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.470
That’s true.

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:11.150
To be told by his master... to marry
someone still in grade school!

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:18.740
Hey Bu-Ling, is KouEnJi Kenpou’s succession techniques that amazing?

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:24.710
That is another matter. Once we meet
my father, we’ll have an answer.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.360
R-Really...

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.440
So why didn’t you mention this before?

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:31.210
Bu-Ling was also kept in the dark...

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:39.210
Geez, that kid sure gets on my nerves!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:43.390
One of these days, I’m really gonna make her suffer!!

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:48.690
That guy too!
Look at him... just a human...

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:53.140
Oy! Tart, mind giving me a hand?

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.140
With what?

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:57.200
A new source for Mew Aqua
has been found.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.780
Ohhh?! What perfect timing!

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.050
Wha..? What is that?!!

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:19.380
Is everyone alright....?!?

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.350
Miss Bu-Ling, welcome back.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.690
Chincha! Hanacha! Lucha! Honcha! Heicha!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.480
Excuse me, I was just
dusting the shelves.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.380
Wh-What have you done?

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.580
M’lady...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:05.260
This is... this is Mother’s and Bu-Ling’s precious album!

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:09.300
Get out of here!!!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:11.090
Sorry, but I...

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:13.430
I said GET OUT!!!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:16.650
Wait! M’lady!

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:25.240
What? Bu-Ling ran away from home?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.230
Yes, that’s right.

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.020
Any idea where she’s gone?!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.780
As a matter of fact, we do.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:31.420
Where’s that?

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.670
Right up there.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.820
M’lady, please come down from there!

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:40.990
No way! You might as well
return to China!

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:43.760
I boarded up the doors and I’m not coming back down!

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.220
M’lady...

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.880
What happened?

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:54.300
Apparently, Yuebin-san ruined Bu-Ling’s
most precious possession.

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.480
Most precious possession?

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.600
Yuebin took Bu-Ling’s cherished
memories and ruined it all!!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.400
M’lady...

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.350
Aliens!!

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:06.390
What?!

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:07.580
They finally revealed themselves.

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:12.040
Mew Aqua is most likely found wherever they show up.

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.780
We’ll split up like last time.

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:17.000
Okay!

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.410
Is everyone here?!

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:24.470
It’s the Aliens. They’ve been searching for
Mew Aqua, and just made their move.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.120
Bu-Ling! This is serious! You have to go too!

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:30.550
No! I’m not going!

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:35.470
I’m not going! I have to figure out my own future!!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.430
Bu-Ling...

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:40.360
Time is running out!
The four of you go!

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.320
Tokyo Mew Mew, Away!!

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:48.270
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:36.410
So much sorrow, Bu-Ling will never forgive this.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:44.200
Hehehe... You seem to be alone.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.830
Who’s there?

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.090
It’s me.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.600
Tart!!

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:56.760
Quiche expected everyone to be away.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:59.480
Things just got more exciting...

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:08.270
<i>And now it’s time for the World Heavy
Weight Championship Tournament!</i>

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:09.570
Wait!

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:14.790
It’s the Mew Mews!

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.630
For the future of the Earth,
I’ll be of service! ~Nya!

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:33.970
<i>What’s going on?!
Why are the Tokyo Mew Mews here?</i>

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:40.310
<i>Mew Mew!! Mew Mew!! Mew Mew!!...</i>

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.310
We’ve been mistaken for them!!

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:42.800
It’s us, the Cuties!

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.930
Ichigo, be serious and make the announcement!

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:45.650
Ah, right.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:50.520
Everyone, listen carefully. Please leave at once!!

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:55.330
What is Tart doing?! Oh crap!

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:04.200
FUSION!!

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.370
What is that?!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:14.810
It’s huge!!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.310
Hey you!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:25.930
<i>Everyone!! Please leave now!!</i>

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.010
She’ll entertain you for
the rest of today.

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.080
I’ll just help myself
to the Mew Aqua.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.980
Quiche...

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.030
Wait!!

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:41.360
Leave it to me!
You guys go after Quiche!

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:42.380
Got it!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.130
Ho-Rai-Den!!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:53.250
What...?! Can’t move in this...

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.920
Where’s the gymnast
I see all the time?!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.430
Hold it!!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.430
I won’t let you...

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.280
Well then... take that!!

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:11.520
Yuebin!

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.350
Ba-ka!

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:14.820
What are you gonna do now?!

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:16.530
M’lady!!

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:33.120
To think I actually said,
“Leave it to me...”

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:35.500
Now look what’s left of me...

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.840
Wha... Just Mew Strawberry?

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.380
Bu-Ling!!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:44.880
Just look at you, can’t even be left on your own!

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:46.970
Tart! Release me at once!

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:50.430
Today Bu-Ling is facing life’s major problems!

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:53.730
Shut up! Let me think of more dreadful
things for entertainment.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:58.030
Chimera Punch!
Use her as a punching-bag!

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:01.070
Bu-Ling...

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:04.670
(Punchie...!)

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:08.840
Mew Strawberry!!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.020
Go! Chimera Punch!!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.340
Dodge, dodge, dodge!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:20.800
Not bad... how about this?

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:25.060
Ah, I can’t move anymore!

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.020
Bu-Ling!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.310
Now, you’re finished!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.200
Bu-Ling!!

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:45.540
KouEnJi Kenpou Special –
Switching Body Technique!

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.960
Eh, when did you..?

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.680
Yuebin, are you alright?!!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:18:02.170
I’m fine, at least I’ve succeeded
in protecting Miss Bu-Ling.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:06.730
Tart! You’ve gone too far!!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:11.200
Geez, what the... Punchy, get her!

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:20.620
KouEnJi Kenpou – Killer move, one
of the results of self-training...

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:23.490
Bu-Ling Attack!!

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.040
Your turn, Mew Strawberry!

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.780
Okay!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:52.440
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:10.440
Why, there wasn’t much here after all...

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.190
Looks like we must look elsewhere.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.670
That’s it for you!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.920
I’m afraid we’ll have to postpone this match.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.590
Geez...

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.290
Are your injuries better now?

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:30.810
Yes. Thanks to everyone’s support
I was able to recover so quickly.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:36.780
Miss Bu-Ling, I must return to
China to further my training.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.740
Yuebin...

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:42.560
I have to get much, much, much stronger than I am.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:44.700
...so I can protect Miss Bu-Ling.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:51.940
Master Wong Taren has said that
for the future of KouEnJi Kenpou,

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:55.620
...it is imperative that I be fully equipped
to protect my wife-to-be.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.420
Yuebin has already protected Bu-Ling.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:06.430
Thank you, m’lady.
Your smile encourages me to do my best.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:12.100
Well then everyone, “zai jian”.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:18.890
Ron Yuebin, you’re always welcome to visit!!

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:20.980
Always, for sure!!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:28.880
Ehh? Retasu is into doll making?

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:33.840
My hobbies are ballet, tea, flowers, and then piano, chamberlain, violin, annnddd...

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.880
We don’t need to know your hobbies!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:40.930
Speaking of which, what are your hobbies, Ichigo?

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:44.770
Me? Of course it’s Aoyama-kun!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.850
That’s called a hobby?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:50.480
Next: “The most important matter –
The ability to trust in someone.”

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:53.660
To put a hobby over life, that’s crazy, isn’t it?
